WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

3
00:00.020 --> 00:01.610
He wanted to have a ritual performed with you

4
00:01.640 --> 00:03.590
to help him get ahead in his career.

5
00:05.430 --> 00:07.630
I have a really bad feeling about this.

6
00:07.650 --> 00:09.800
You want to get close to him for the case, right?

7
00:09.810 --> 00:11.880
There's nothing to investigate about him.

8
00:11.970 --> 00:13.310
You think something's off about Mungkorn, too, right?

9
00:13.320 --> 00:14.350
It's like...

10
00:14.380 --> 00:15.790
He's under some kind of spell, right?

11
00:15.820 --> 00:17.350
If he gets to sleep with Mungkorn tonight,

12
00:17.370 --> 00:18.670
I don't think things will end well for Mungkorn.

13
00:18.690 --> 00:19.500
I win.

14
00:19.530 --> 00:22.130
I'll try to make him remember one more time.

15
00:24.000 --> 00:25.850
- Mungkorn, don't leave. - Saming, I want to go home.

16
00:25.870 --> 00:29.900
♪And all I want is for it to belong to you♪

17
00:31.260 --> 00:32.310
Ladies and gentlemen, meet...

18
00:32.760 --> 00:34.890
Pol.Snr.Sgt.Maj. Mungkorn Phianwanich.

19
00:37.600 --> 00:39.130
He is my husband.

20
00:40.740 --> 00:43.200
We have been legally married

21
00:43.220 --> 00:44.400
for a while now.

22
00:46.830 --> 00:47.870
Since when were they married?

23
00:51.620 --> 00:54.190
I'd like to ask you to wish us

24
00:54.220 --> 00:56.820
a happy life together with nothing standing in our way.

25
00:58.510 --> 01:00.980
May you all be witnesses to our promise

26
01:01.070 --> 01:02.220
to love

27
01:02.560 --> 01:04.210
and cherish each other forever.

28
01:05.430 --> 01:07.860
And no one will ever come between us

29
01:07.920 --> 01:10.720
or tear us apart.

30
01:21.920 --> 01:24.860
(Mungkorn will be freed from the love spell)

31
01:24.880 --> 01:29.670
(when you give him a heartfelt kiss in front of everyone)

32
01:29.690 --> 01:32.140
(and declare your love for him)

33
01:32.160 --> 01:34.170
(for all to hear.)

34
01:35.810 --> 01:38.890
It's like a sudden, chaotic electrical surge, My Lady!

35
02:04.260 --> 02:05.280
Thear.

36
02:08.360 --> 02:09.990
You're back, aren't you?

37
02:22.010 --> 02:23.430
That's more like it.

38
02:51.260 --> 02:52.160
Hold it right there.

39
02:52.400 --> 02:53.870
Why the hell are you in my way? Get lost!

40
02:53.890 --> 02:54.680
Here's the warrant.

41
02:57.160 --> 02:59.420
Inspector Saming, you're under arrest.

42
02:59.800 --> 03:00.930
What am I being charged with?

43
03:01.520 --> 03:04.590
"Distribution, possession with intent to distribute,

44
03:04.620 --> 03:08.270
and/or illegal consumption of Category 1 narcotics."

45
03:10.880 --> 03:12.190
We already know

46
03:12.210 --> 03:14.150
that you're the leader of the Black Bull.

47
03:15.150 --> 03:16.440
What evidence do you have?

48
03:17.090 --> 03:18.500
You'd better not try to frame me.

49
03:18.710 --> 03:20.310
It came straight from your house.

50
03:28.980 --> 03:29.810
Phuwin.

51
03:30.940 --> 03:31.860
- Huh? - These teeth.

52
03:34.770 --> 03:36.570
Great, now we have more evidence.

53
03:37.260 --> 03:38.560
Let me take a photo of them.

54
03:41.680 --> 03:43.780
(Mungkorn left this notebook for you.)

55
03:45.610 --> 03:48.480
(Inspector Saming was spying on us through the gifts he gave Mungkorn.)

56
03:48.510 --> 03:50.590
(And we've suspected him of being involved with the dealer)

57
03:50.860 --> 03:53.250
(who died from the poison hidden in his teeth in the interrogation room.)

58
04:01.930 --> 04:02.810
Sh*t,

59
04:03.200 --> 04:04.170
what's wrong with him?

60
04:27.790 --> 04:29.120
- Sergeant, take him away. - This way, sir.

61
04:30.930 --> 04:31.670
Let's go.

62
04:33.270 --> 04:34.170
Don't touch me.

63
04:34.820 --> 04:35.700
I can walk on my own.

64
04:46.820 --> 04:47.750
Are you okay?

65
04:48.540 --> 04:50.420
Let's sit here and get some fresh air for a bit.

66
04:52.020 --> 04:54.960
What have I done these past few days?

67
04:56.790 --> 04:59.560
I barely remember anything.

68
05:03.840 --> 05:05.270
It's better that you don't.

69
05:06.140 --> 05:08.770
I really don't want you to remember any of it.

70
05:09.440 --> 05:11.900
Because you were so mean to your lover.

71
05:16.830 --> 05:17.560
"Lover"?

72
05:20.260 --> 05:22.400
So you consider yourself my lover now?

73
05:24.220 --> 05:25.620
I am, from now on.

74
05:26.460 --> 05:27.930
We're official now, after all.

75
05:38.230 --> 05:39.130
I...

76
05:39.870 --> 05:43.070
really thought I was going to lose you to a terrible person like Saming.

77
05:47.110 --> 05:48.110
Thank you

78
05:48.990 --> 05:50.300
for not letting me go.

79
05:53.750 --> 05:56.470
A life where you're forced to love someone like that...

80
05:59.580 --> 06:01.270
must be incredibly tragic.

81
06:07.820 --> 06:08.880
And what about with me?

82
06:11.400 --> 06:12.800
Do you feel forced, too?

83
06:14.060 --> 06:15.580
At first, I did.

84
06:18.520 --> 06:21.080
But not anymore.

85
06:21.430 --> 06:22.500
I'm here because I want to be.

86
06:41.460 --> 06:43.030
How are you feeling? Are you okay?

87
06:43.680 --> 06:45.840
I don't think the curse has completely worn off yet.

88
06:46.350 --> 06:49.350
Probably because I'm trying so hard to remember what happened.

89
06:52.780 --> 06:54.730
I think we should head inside and get some rest. Come on.

90
06:54.760 --> 06:55.590
Okay.

91
06:56.610 --> 06:57.390
Hey!

92
06:58.370 --> 06:59.530
I just thought of something better.

93
07:00.860 --> 07:02.570
I think you need to freshen up.

94
07:03.580 --> 07:04.700
How?

95
07:06.080 --> 07:08.140
- Like this! - Hey, you!

96
07:11.890 --> 07:12.870
What are you doing?

97
07:15.860 --> 07:16.690
No!

98
07:16.710 --> 07:18.410
Come on, you need to freshen up!

99
07:18.440 --> 07:20.530
- Stop it! Hey! - In you go, Mungkorn!

100
07:29.910 --> 07:32.740
Thear, what is wrong with you?

101
07:33.370 --> 07:34.260
So?

102
07:34.590 --> 07:35.650
Feeling refreshed now?

103
07:37.170 --> 07:38.830
Stop trying to remember the past.

104
07:39.200 --> 07:41.580
Let's focus on making new memories together instead.

105
07:43.490 --> 07:46.260
I have some vague memories, actually.

106
07:47.930 --> 07:49.270
I remember the touch.

107
07:50.690 --> 07:51.770
I remember the scent...

108
07:52.300 --> 07:55.240
of the person I rode with when I left Saming's house.

109
07:56.630 --> 07:57.770
What did it smell like?

110
08:01.250 --> 08:03.160
It was the scent that made me feel...

111
08:05.740 --> 08:06.980
safe.

112
08:27.420 --> 08:28.200
See?

113
08:28.620 --> 08:30.340
No matter what happens,

114
08:30.900 --> 08:32.840
I'll always be in your heart.

115
08:33.570 --> 08:35.180
Nothing can ever take that away.

116
08:37.040 --> 08:38.780
Don't get too ahead of yourself.

117
08:39.670 --> 08:41.580
If you keep acting like a jerk,

118
08:42.580 --> 08:43.860
I'm really leaving for good.

119
08:47.050 --> 08:47.960
Wait, wait.

120
08:49.000 --> 08:50.730
Stay and dance with me.

121
08:52.270 --> 08:53.670
In the pool? Seriously?

122
08:53.700 --> 08:54.490
Of course.

123
08:54.940 --> 08:58.600
To celebrate having you back in my arms again.

124
08:58.990 --> 09:03.260
♪All I want when our hearts finally intertwine♪

125
09:03.290 --> 09:08.440
♪Is for you to keep the promise you made that time♪

126
09:08.460 --> 09:12.960
♪Take care of my heart and make me feel divine,♪

127
09:12.990 --> 09:21.110
♪Make all my dreams come true with your love that's mine♪

128
09:40.680 --> 09:41.650
From now on,

129
09:42.280 --> 09:45.220
we're going public for everyone to see.

130
09:47.240 --> 09:49.100
I've been waiting for this day for a long time.

131
10:14.840 --> 10:17.660
(Yin as Theartha)

132
10:22.630 --> 10:25.320
(War as Mungkorn)

133
10:29.470 --> 10:31.330
(Shane as Phuwin)

134
10:32.260 --> 10:35.140
(Boss as Lukplub)

135
10:37.660 --> 10:39.330
(Kit as Kanin)

136
10:39.780 --> 10:41.170
(Tang as Nadol)

137
10:46.310 --> 10:50.180
(Tae as Saming)

138
11:34.420 --> 11:36.040
Why are you all over me so early?

139
11:36.900 --> 11:37.840
What do you want?

140
11:40.150 --> 11:41.570
I don't really want anything.

141
11:46.950 --> 11:49.460
I just want to wake up to a beautiful view like this forever.

142
11:50.760 --> 11:52.740
You're the best view in all of Northern Thailand.

143
11:54.150 --> 11:55.750
There you go, exaggerating again.

144
11:57.700 --> 11:58.830
I'm not exaggerating.

145
11:59.640 --> 12:01.260
A view this good...

146
12:03.150 --> 12:04.570
I want it all to myself.

147
12:05.370 --> 12:06.580
I'm not sharing it with anyone.

148
12:09.510 --> 12:10.580
See this part right here?

149
12:12.840 --> 12:14.070
It's like a mountain range.

150
12:15.850 --> 12:18.660
As you drive up, see?

151
12:19.550 --> 12:22.950
It's a bumpy ride because you have to cross so many peaks.

152
12:24.010 --> 12:25.350
At least five or six of them.

153
12:26.710 --> 12:27.690
But it's okay.

154
12:27.910 --> 12:29.380
I've always loved a bit of an adventure anyway.

155
12:31.410 --> 12:33.360
Once you cross the mountains to this point...

156
12:34.120 --> 12:36.400
you reach the viewpoint of these two peaks.

157
12:37.480 --> 12:38.860
Drive carefully then.

158
12:39.150 --> 12:40.760
Watch out, or you might fall off a cliff.

159
12:42.570 --> 12:44.350
Once I've made it this far...

160
12:44.660 --> 12:45.960
I'm not afraid of anything anymore.

161
12:47.590 --> 12:50.390
Now I must decide which one to visit.

162
12:51.780 --> 12:53.450
The left one?

163
12:54.710 --> 12:56.550
But if I go for the left...

164
12:57.250 --> 12:59.150
the right one might get lonely.

165
13:03.500 --> 13:05.020
Help me choose. What should I do?

166
13:05.220 --> 13:06.770
I guess I'll just have to visit both.

167
13:07.000 --> 13:07.840
Let's start with this one.

168
13:09.050 --> 13:09.930
Thear.

169
13:09.960 --> 13:12.020
Wasn't last night enough for you? Huh?

170
13:12.730 --> 13:13.880
Alright, finished with this peak.

171
13:13.910 --> 13:15.080
Now onto the next one.

172
13:18.200 --> 13:19.210
Stop it.

173
13:19.490 --> 13:20.580
That tickles!

174
13:22.770 --> 13:25.230
There's no such thing as "enough" for me.

175
13:26.130 --> 13:27.130
You know...

176
13:28.180 --> 13:29.910
simple things like this

177
13:30.290 --> 13:32.160
are exactly what I've wanted to do for a long time.

178
13:33.050 --> 13:34.520
Married life...

179
13:35.430 --> 13:36.970
Waking up next to each other,

180
13:37.350 --> 13:38.890
cuddling in bed,

181
13:38.920 --> 13:41.100
sharing meals, and showering together.

182
13:42.360 --> 13:43.750
None of it is inherently special.

183
13:44.330 --> 13:45.490
It's the person who makes it special.

184
13:49.150 --> 13:50.110
And do you know...

185
13:50.550 --> 13:54.950
that I've wanted to be a good partner for a long time, too?

186
13:59.570 --> 14:00.480
In what way?

187
14:01.730 --> 14:02.640
Well...

188
14:04.430 --> 14:06.960
by taking the best care of you.

189
14:07.860 --> 14:09.240
Both at the dinner table...

190
14:10.570 --> 14:11.650
and in bed.

191
14:13.790 --> 14:15.420
Well, we're in bed right now.

192
14:15.670 --> 14:16.780
So take care of me. Come here.

193
14:18.630 --> 14:20.100
And how exactly should you "take care" of me in bed?

194
14:20.490 --> 14:22.520
Should we save that for when we get home?

195
14:22.860 --> 14:24.180
No point paying for extra time here.

196
14:24.940 --> 14:28.500
Oh, come on! We're already in bed!

197
14:28.520 --> 14:29.650
Take care of me.

198
14:32.270 --> 14:33.070
Tell you what.

199
14:33.590 --> 14:35.790
Let's have breakfast at the hotel first.

200
14:35.910 --> 14:37.770
Then once we're back home,

201
14:38.210 --> 14:39.700
I'll cook for you.

202
14:39.720 --> 14:42.860
We'll go grocery shopping at the market together.

203
14:42.880 --> 14:43.830
How does that sound?

204
14:44.050 --> 14:45.630
But I'm hungry right now.

205
14:45.650 --> 14:46.740
What should we do?

206
14:47.360 --> 14:48.190
Well...

207
14:48.810 --> 14:50.230
then let me have a bite of you.

208
14:52.800 --> 14:54.970
- Wasn't last night enough? - Not even close.

209
14:57.780 --> 14:58.440
So kissy.

210
15:14.640 --> 15:15.720
Want some fries?

211
15:21.160 --> 15:22.390
Is it good, Phuwin?

212
15:23.570 --> 15:25.860
Anything you feed me tastes delicious.

213
15:26.670 --> 15:27.890
Whoa, Phuwin.

214
15:27.920 --> 15:30.170
You're being so sweet. Guess you need no sugar in your coffee.

215
15:30.200 --> 15:32.280
Well, I never add sugar anyway

216
15:32.310 --> 15:35.640
because Lukplub provides all the sweetness I need.

217
15:36.020 --> 15:37.750
Someone with no love life like you...

218
15:37.930 --> 15:38.930
probably wouldn't understand.

219
15:39.330 --> 15:40.190
I do have someone.

220
15:41.820 --> 15:43.490
Look, he's walking over now.

221
15:47.190 --> 15:47.970
Whoa.

222
15:48.110 --> 15:48.840
- What's with you? - Good morning.

223
15:48.870 --> 15:49.570
Good morning.

224
15:50.520 --> 15:51.380
Mind if I join you?

225
15:51.410 --> 15:52.260
Please, take a seat.

226
15:52.290 --> 15:53.310
Go ahead.

227
15:53.880 --> 15:54.720
Feel free.

228
15:56.940 --> 15:58.630
- Want some salad? - Sure.

229
16:01.320 --> 16:02.240
Is it good?

230
16:04.170 --> 16:06.000
And how's Mungkorn doing?

231
16:06.530 --> 16:07.970
Isn't he coming down for breakfast?

232
16:10.930 --> 16:12.070
Inspector Thear said

233
16:12.100 --> 16:13.620
he's still not feeling very well.

234
16:13.650 --> 16:15.140
So he wanted him to get some more rest.

235
16:17.290 --> 16:18.880
Resting, my ass.

236
16:18.900 --> 16:22.030
That bastard is probably busy "checking on Mungkorn" by now.

237
16:27.840 --> 16:29.930
When are you going to let me take care of you?

238
16:31.810 --> 16:34.340
I think I can handle myself just fine.

239
16:55.640 --> 16:56.460
Give it to me.

240
16:56.490 --> 16:57.520
- Come on. - Hey...

241
16:57.550 --> 16:58.450
Let me peel it for you.

242
17:26.860 --> 17:29.370
I think I finally understand

243
17:29.480 --> 17:31.750
why you were so annoyed with us.

244
17:33.950 --> 17:35.500
I don't like being challenged.

245
17:38.630 --> 17:41.310
Anyway, I'm rooting for both of you.

246
17:41.720 --> 17:43.380
Both the one who wants to care for the other...

247
17:44.070 --> 17:46.320
and the one who wants to be cared for.

248
17:48.660 --> 17:49.560
Would you like some coffee?

249
18:05.070 --> 18:06.460
Everything is all set.

250
18:06.490 --> 18:09.150
Thank you for letting us be part of your special moment.

251
18:09.180 --> 18:11.080
Congratulations to you both.

252
18:11.180 --> 18:13.920
Inspector Theartha and Sergeant Mungkorn

253
18:13.940 --> 18:16.940
are now husband and husband.

254
18:16.960 --> 18:19.100
Whoa, how do you know about us?

255
18:19.290 --> 18:20.600
Well,

256
18:20.620 --> 18:22.760
with you announcing it that loudly in the ballroom...

257
18:22.780 --> 18:24.280
how could anyone not know?

258
18:25.300 --> 18:28.040
Please come back and stay with us again.

259
18:28.340 --> 18:28.960
Thank you.

260
18:28.980 --> 18:30.440
- Yes, thank you so much. - Thank you.

261
18:35.950 --> 18:36.880
What are you smiling about?

262
18:39.100 --> 18:40.940
I don't know. I'm just blushing.

263
18:42.460 --> 18:45.260
It feels so heartwarming when people call us that.

264
18:46.110 --> 18:47.810
It's like the first time

265
18:47.830 --> 18:50.510
I've truly felt like I'm your husband.

266
18:51.520 --> 18:52.650
Is it really that much?

267
18:53.160 --> 18:54.260
Alright then.

268
18:54.290 --> 18:57.330
From now on, I'll be the one bragging about you.

269
18:57.560 --> 18:59.380
Seriously, with a husband this cute, how could I not show you off?

270
18:59.410 --> 19:01.190
- In what way? - Perfect timing! Hey, you!

271
19:01.220 --> 19:02.310
- Going somewhere? - Yes?

272
19:02.530 --> 19:04.330
- I'm going to see my partner. - Can you talk to me for a second?

273
19:04.580 --> 19:05.920
- Sure. - This is my husband.

274
19:05.940 --> 19:07.250
His name is Mungkorn.

275
19:07.280 --> 19:07.960
Right.

276
19:07.980 --> 19:08.990
My mom forced us to get married.

277
19:09.020 --> 19:10.540
At first, we weren't actually in love.

278
19:10.640 --> 19:13.020
But as time went by, we truly fell for each other.

279
19:13.130 --> 19:15.880
And now, I'm going to love him until the day I die.

280
19:16.010 --> 19:17.960
- Heck, if he dies, I'm going with him. - That's enough.

281
19:17.980 --> 19:19.760
We're both cops. Cool, right?

282
19:19.790 --> 19:20.620
Very cool.

283
19:20.650 --> 19:21.460
Yeah?

284
19:21.660 --> 19:23.790
But wait, there's more! Listen.

285
19:23.810 --> 19:26.110
We used to fight like crazy. There were so many obstacles.

286
19:26.130 --> 19:27.580
But we just made up yesterday.

287
19:27.730 --> 19:30.460
Now that we're good, I decided to go all out.

288
19:30.480 --> 19:31.860
Ugh, enough already!

289
19:32.190 --> 19:33.750
Why are you telling him that much?

290
19:33.770 --> 19:35.180
He probably knows everything about us by now.

291
19:36.510 --> 19:38.550
I'm sorry on behalf of my husband.

292
19:38.580 --> 19:39.880
He's just a little overexcited.

293
19:39.910 --> 19:40.840
It's quite alright.

294
19:40.860 --> 19:41.950
My apologies.

295
19:42.220 --> 19:43.970
Go crazy again tonight, okay?

296
19:44.250 --> 19:44.710
Wait...

297
19:44.740 --> 19:46.540
- Looks like you like it! - Ugh!

298
19:46.560 --> 19:47.640
Let's go home.

299
19:48.400 --> 19:50.860
Hey, you and your partner can have a chat with me later.

300
19:51.770 --> 19:56.670
(3 days later, Chiang Mai)

301
19:59.700 --> 20:01.420
- Thank you. - Thank you.

302
20:02.120 --> 20:03.920
Believe it or not,

303
20:04.150 --> 20:05.780
I've never shopped at a market before.

304
20:06.570 --> 20:07.760
I can understand that.

305
20:08.070 --> 20:11.550
You grew up like a young master, with everyone doing everything for you.

306
20:11.570 --> 20:13.260
Well, that's all changing now,

307
20:13.290 --> 20:14.440
ever since I have you.

308
20:20.110 --> 20:22.070
Half a kilo of bacon, please.

309
20:22.090 --> 20:22.970
Okay, dear.

310
20:23.860 --> 20:26.050
I'm thinking of learning a new style of cooking.

311
20:26.650 --> 20:27.900
Just to take a break from Northern food.

312
20:29.430 --> 20:31.440
I can eat it all the time. I'll never get bored of it.

313
20:32.730 --> 20:34.550
Let me do something nice for my husband.

314
20:36.320 --> 20:39.070
But I don't know if you'll like it or not.

315
20:40.660 --> 20:41.530
I don't mind.

316
20:42.320 --> 20:45.860
As long as you're the one cooking, I'll eat anything.

317
20:46.750 --> 20:47.950
We'll see about that.

318
20:48.820 --> 20:50.380
- All set? - Yes.

319
20:51.350 --> 20:53.420
- Thank you. - Let me carry those. Come here.

320
20:53.790 --> 20:54.710
Here you go.

321
20:54.740 --> 20:55.600
Thank you, dear.

322
20:55.630 --> 20:56.670
Thank you.

323
21:07.800 --> 21:08.570
Wow.

324
21:11.220 --> 21:12.710
That roti looks so delicious.

325
21:13.770 --> 21:15.130
But judging by the crowd...

326
21:15.540 --> 21:17.730
it'll probably take half an hour.

327
21:20.060 --> 21:22.030
Want some? I'll wait in line for you.

328
21:22.930 --> 21:23.920
It's okay.

329
21:24.090 --> 21:25.370
I'd rather stand and wait with you.

330
21:26.680 --> 21:28.050
It's fine. I'll queue up myself.

331
21:28.080 --> 21:29.640
You go put the groceries in the car.

332
21:29.820 --> 21:31.330
Turn on the AC and stay cool while you wait.

333
21:31.350 --> 21:32.420
I'll buy it for you.

334
21:32.650 --> 21:34.170
- You sure? - Yeah.

335
21:35.430 --> 21:36.420
Thank you.

336
22:08.690 --> 22:09.850
Hello, Uncle.

337
22:10.430 --> 22:11.530
Is something wrong?

338
22:12.130 --> 22:13.970
Saming was released.

339
22:13.990 --> 22:15.060
Just this morning.

340
22:15.890 --> 22:17.080
How is that even possible?

341
22:17.110 --> 22:19.480
I thought I'd gathered solid evidence.

342
22:19.500 --> 22:21.970
The prosecutor said the evidence was insufficient.

343
22:22.030 --> 22:23.580
So he was released.

344
22:23.600 --> 22:27.350
I don't know where he's planning to go or what his next move is.

345
22:27.690 --> 22:31.070
But one thing's for sure, he's probably furious with you two.

346
22:31.210 --> 22:32.340
Understood, Uncle.

347
22:33.540 --> 22:34.540
Thank you so much.

348
22:42.140 --> 22:43.870
- Can I order now? - Certainly.

349
22:43.890 --> 22:46.540
Two with egg and extra condensed milk, please.

350
22:59.380 --> 23:06.490
(TD 54006 Chiang Mai)

351
23:07.250 --> 23:08.670
- Hey, kid. Let me help. - What a mess.

352
23:09.120 --> 23:09.860
There you go.

353
23:10.420 --> 23:11.110
It's okay, bro.

354
23:11.130 --> 23:13.200
Come on, I'll help before you drop anything else.

355
23:13.990 --> 23:14.720
Thank you.

356
23:14.740 --> 23:16.710
Don't mention it. I work here at the market.

357
23:18.470 --> 23:19.880
Thank you so much.

358
23:21.560 --> 23:22.180
It's so hot...

359
23:46.980 --> 23:49.970
(TD 54006 Chiang Mai)

360
23:52.010 --> 23:52.910
Mungkorn!

361
23:53.110 --> 23:54.330
Mungkorn! Mungkorn!

362
23:57.850 --> 23:58.890
Mungkorn!

363
24:00.530 --> 24:01.500
Mungkorn!

364
24:03.750 --> 24:04.730
Mungkorn!

365
24:11.280 --> 24:13.250
(TD 54006 Chiang Mai)

366
24:13.280 --> 24:14.280
Mungkorn!

367
24:20.230 --> 24:22.620
(TD 54006 Chiang Mai)

368
24:22.640 --> 24:23.480
Sh*t!

369
24:40.260 --> 24:41.550
How's it going, old friend?

370
24:42.030 --> 24:42.990
Saming!

371
24:43.780 --> 24:44.940
What did you do to Mungkorn?

372
24:45.130 --> 24:46.350
Chill out.

373
24:46.870 --> 24:48.490
I haven't even done anything yet.

374
24:48.610 --> 24:50.740
But if you don't do exactly as I say...

375
24:51.440 --> 24:54.460
I'll chop off Mungkorn's fingers one by one.

376
24:55.100 --> 24:57.080
Until there isn't a single finger left for your ring.

377
24:57.100 --> 25:00.030
Hey, you bastard! Don't you dare touch him!

378
25:00.310 --> 25:01.640
Just take it out on me.

379
25:01.820 --> 25:02.950
Don't worry. I will.

380
25:03.700 --> 25:05.700
Come see me. I'll send you the address.

381
25:06.340 --> 25:08.440
Don't tell anyone about this,

382
25:09.440 --> 25:11.440
or Mungkorn won't leave in one piece.

383
25:11.940 --> 25:13.830
Hey, wait! Listen to me!

384
25:13.910 --> 25:14.710
Hey!

385
25:23.560 --> 25:26.160
(TD 54006 Chiang Mai)

386
25:28.530 --> 25:33.110
(TD 54006 Chiang Mai)

387
26:58.800 --> 26:59.880
Let me go!

388
27:00.950 --> 27:01.950
You bastard!

389
27:02.100 --> 27:03.080
Mungkorn.

390
27:11.270 --> 27:12.170
Help!

391
27:22.850 --> 27:24.000
Help me!

392
27:28.800 --> 27:29.820
Thear!

393
27:31.440 --> 27:32.420
Are you okay?

394
27:33.030 --> 27:34.040
I'm fine.

395
27:34.790 --> 27:35.850
You sure you're alright?

396
27:35.940 --> 27:36.690
Alright.

397
27:36.710 --> 27:37.680
Don't be afraid.

398
27:42.760 --> 27:44.360
I'll take care of every single one of these bastards.

399
27:47.640 --> 27:48.820
Thear, look out!

400
28:01.580 --> 28:03.030
What a weak-ass kick.

401
28:13.800 --> 28:14.720
Come on! Bring it!

402
28:20.310 --> 28:21.240
Stop!

403
28:24.700 --> 28:25.630
What did you say?

404
28:26.600 --> 28:27.800
Enough already.

405
28:28.430 --> 28:29.560
Let's just talk this out.

406
28:31.350 --> 28:32.210
Enough?

407
28:33.170 --> 28:34.250
Like hell it is!

408
28:37.460 --> 28:38.150
No!

409
28:55.970 --> 28:56.750
Get over here.

410
28:58.440 --> 28:59.640
Stop it, Saming.

411
29:00.490 --> 29:01.640
That's enough!

412
29:15.680 --> 29:16.590
Thear!

413
29:16.900 --> 29:17.850
Thear!

414
29:33.680 --> 29:36.070
Well, look at you, Inspector Thear.

415
29:36.890 --> 29:38.990
You couldn't even put me behind bars.

416
29:41.180 --> 29:43.730
What the hell do you think you can do to me? Huh?

417
29:44.510 --> 29:45.980
I'm begging you, Saming.

418
29:46.700 --> 29:47.970
Just let Mungkorn go.

419
29:49.780 --> 29:51.820
And settle this with me instead.

420
29:52.540 --> 29:54.610
Is playing the self-sacrificing saint

421
29:55.290 --> 29:57.560
why Mungkorn is so head over heels for you?

422
29:59.690 --> 30:00.760
Is it, Mungkorn?

423
30:01.650 --> 30:03.260
I can also take care of you.

424
30:04.260 --> 30:06.380
Why don't you love me instead? Huh?

425
30:06.550 --> 30:08.330
Because I know who you really are.

426
30:08.950 --> 30:10.320
You're just a total fraud.

427
30:12.440 --> 30:14.030
But Inspector Thear is sincere.

428
30:14.740 --> 30:16.530
I love him without needing any black magic.

429
30:17.430 --> 30:18.250
You...

430
30:19.150 --> 30:20.770
could never even come close to him.

431
30:22.250 --> 30:23.140
Good.

432
30:24.220 --> 30:25.450
Praise each other all you want.

433
30:25.980 --> 30:28.520
Let's see just how deep your love really goes.

434
30:31.910 --> 30:33.260
I'll give you a choice.

435
30:35.100 --> 30:36.460
Between him...

436
30:43.120 --> 30:44.240
and your mother.

437
30:47.830 --> 30:49.810
I already have men watching her in Phayao.

438
31:01.900 --> 31:02.720
Choose.

439
31:04.540 --> 31:06.500
Don't you dare lay a finger on my mother!

440
31:07.490 --> 31:10.050
Well, that's entirely up to you.

441
31:10.690 --> 31:13.230
You can't have it all.

442
31:13.810 --> 31:15.830
If there's a wedding...

443
31:16.310 --> 31:17.880
there must be a funeral.

444
31:21.330 --> 31:22.160
Choose!

445
31:23.780 --> 31:25.000
Please...

446
31:26.110 --> 31:27.800
Let my mother and Inspector Thear go.

447
31:28.540 --> 31:30.240
I'll do anything you want.

448
31:33.490 --> 31:35.500
I'll do anything for you.

449
31:36.280 --> 31:38.810
I'll even marry you if that's what you want.

450
31:38.850 --> 31:40.110
No, Mungkorn!

451
31:40.860 --> 31:43.280
I won't let you end up with a piece of sh*t like him.

452
31:43.340 --> 31:44.560
Shut the hell up!

453
31:44.900 --> 31:45.950
Time's up.

454
31:47.660 --> 31:48.870
It's simple.

455
31:51.390 --> 31:52.270
Just choose!

456
31:59.160 --> 32:00.060
Mungkorn.

457
32:01.590 --> 32:05.930
Your mother is the most important person in your life.

458
32:07.260 --> 32:08.630
Don't worry about me.

459
32:10.400 --> 32:12.830
During the months we've spent together...

460
32:13.670 --> 32:15.620
I've been truly happy.

461
32:16.840 --> 32:19.540
But from now on, stop doing things for me.

462
32:21.590 --> 32:23.530
Live your life for yourself.

463
32:24.750 --> 32:25.420
Okay?

464
32:26.460 --> 32:29.070
But you're an important person in my life, too.

465
32:46.600 --> 32:48.760
Stop! Don't you dare come any closer!

466
32:49.990 --> 32:51.720
Get together! All of you, go!

467
32:52.020 --> 32:53.190
Don't come in!

468
32:54.290 --> 32:56.060
Or I'll blow his brains out.

469
32:56.190 --> 32:57.640
Untie Mungkorn right now!

470
32:58.270 --> 33:00.250
Tell your men to do it, goddammit!

471
33:01.310 --> 33:02.360
Untie him.

472
33:11.660 --> 33:12.550
No!

473
33:14.250 --> 33:14.850
Go!

474
33:16.230 --> 33:17.150
Go, Mungkorn!

475
33:20.130 --> 33:21.090
After them!

476
34:29.690 --> 34:30.500
Thear!

477
34:43.180 --> 34:44.440
Just come out.

478
34:45.930 --> 34:47.520
I've got this whole place shut down.

479
34:49.960 --> 34:51.900
You've got nowhere to run.

480
34:53.330 --> 34:54.320
This time...

481
34:54.870 --> 34:56.940
I'm not giving you a choice anymore.

482
34:58.230 --> 35:00.620
I'll let you both die together.

483
35:02.310 --> 35:03.200
Huh?

484
35:05.460 --> 35:07.130
It's pretty romantic, actually.

485
35:11.100 --> 35:13.940
A wedding and a funeral just a few months apart.

486
35:15.910 --> 35:16.630
Huh?

487
35:18.530 --> 35:19.460
Come out!

488
35:23.350 --> 35:24.260
Thear.

489
35:24.410 --> 35:25.510
Thear.

490
35:26.470 --> 35:28.740
You're not actually any better than me.

491
35:30.160 --> 35:31.610
You're just lucky.

492
35:33.650 --> 35:34.740
Mungkorn.

493
35:36.020 --> 35:39.740
Choosing the wrong man will haunt you for life.

494
35:50.140 --> 35:52.050
Hey, keep quiet.

495
37:19.460 --> 37:20.460
I told you.

496
37:21.630 --> 37:23.330
You'll never beat me.

497
37:56.100 --> 37:58.430
Saming, you're not getting away this time.

498
37:58.650 --> 38:00.330
You've just earned yourself even more charges.

499
38:00.610 --> 38:01.630
Hands up!

500
38:08.060 --> 38:09.110
Do it!

501
38:12.570 --> 38:14.010
Do you want to know why?

502
38:14.790 --> 38:16.290
It's because I have friends.

503
38:16.440 --> 38:17.400
That's why I won.

504
38:31.280 --> 38:32.040
Come here.

505
38:37.100 --> 38:37.920
Mungkorn.

506
38:39.330 --> 38:40.430
Mungkorn, how are you?

507
38:40.830 --> 38:41.760
I'm fine.

508
38:43.460 --> 38:44.530
My mom.

509
38:46.490 --> 38:47.380
My mom...

510
38:49.670 --> 38:51.350
It's okay, Mungkorn. It's okay.

511
38:51.500 --> 38:53.010
Your mom will be safe.

512
39:09.850 --> 39:10.900
The wound is quite deep.

513
39:10.930 --> 39:13.510
I'll give you some basic first aid for now.

514
39:13.540 --> 39:16.030
But you'll need to go to the hospital for an X-ray later.

515
39:16.700 --> 39:18.140
Is it really that bad?

516
39:18.850 --> 39:20.820
Will I still be able to use my hand?

517
39:22.200 --> 39:23.710
It shouldn't be too serious.

518
39:24.200 --> 39:26.260
You survived getting shot last time, didn't you?

519
39:26.600 --> 39:28.180
A hand injury is nothing next to that.

520
39:31.170 --> 39:33.410
As for the paperwork, I can take care of it for you.

521
39:33.610 --> 39:34.710
You can just hand it over to me.

522
39:37.500 --> 39:38.780
It's my dominant hand, too.

523
39:39.620 --> 39:40.830
I can't do anything at all.

524
39:43.750 --> 39:45.650
It doesn't matter if you can't do anything.

525
39:45.870 --> 39:47.700
You have a husband to do everything for you now.

526
39:52.060 --> 39:53.990
And don't worry about your mom.

527
39:54.540 --> 39:56.140
Inspector Thear is handling it.

528
40:00.030 --> 40:01.810
Everything's clear on the Phayao side, right?

529
40:02.980 --> 40:03.750
Is that so?

530
40:03.790 --> 40:04.790
It's all settled?

531
40:06.340 --> 40:07.400
Okay, alright.

532
40:08.040 --> 40:09.140
Thank you so much.

533
40:09.960 --> 40:11.390
I'll find a way to repay you.

534
40:20.200 --> 40:21.820
I've already handed Saming over.

535
40:21.970 --> 40:23.660
He's definitely not getting away this time.

536
40:25.290 --> 40:26.930
No higher-ups are going to stick their necks out for him.

537
40:26.950 --> 40:28.300
They wouldn't want to get dragged down with him.

538
40:33.010 --> 40:35.580
When is this string of bad luck ever going to end for you and Mungkorn?

539
40:36.040 --> 40:37.410
It's just one disaster after another.

540
40:37.980 --> 40:40.860
If I hadn't been tracking the GPS on Saming's car since last time,

541
40:40.890 --> 40:42.390
I might not have made it in time to help you.

542
40:43.320 --> 40:45.390
Why didn't you tell your friends what you were planning to do?

543
40:47.170 --> 40:49.160
I don't think this has anything to do with bad luck anymore.

544
40:49.760 --> 40:51.960
This was all just Saming being a complete piece of sh*t.

545
40:55.480 --> 40:56.640
Honestly, though...

546
40:57.870 --> 41:00.060
with all these terrible things,

547
41:00.660 --> 41:02.100
I'm starting to have my doubts.

548
41:04.670 --> 41:08.210
What if Mungkorn and I just aren't meant for each other after all?

549
41:10.360 --> 41:11.090
Thear.

550
41:12.560 --> 41:14.000
I received the report.

551
41:14.180 --> 41:14.960
I was worried.

552
41:15.450 --> 41:16.400
How are you doing?

553
41:19.740 --> 41:21.690
I'm okay, Dad. It's nothing serious.

554
41:22.890 --> 41:25.050
And Mungkorn? Is he alright?

555
41:39.740 --> 41:41.190
He got a bit banged up, Dad.

556
41:45.180 --> 41:46.200
Well, that's good then.

557
41:48.290 --> 41:51.740
Your mother's plan to ward off bad luck by getting you married...

558
41:53.240 --> 41:55.240
I don't think it worked at all.

559
42:13.470 --> 42:14.220
Dad.

560
42:17.360 --> 42:18.660
I have a favor to ask.

561
42:24.380 --> 42:25.680
I think it's finally time

562
42:26.900 --> 42:29.440
for me to fulfill the promise I made to Mungkorn.

563
42:33.180 --> 42:34.290
What promise?

564
42:45.100 --> 42:46.850
- Here, let me light it for you. - Okay.

565
42:46.870 --> 42:47.800
Thank you.

566
42:48.500 --> 42:50.430
My hand is totally out of commission.

567
42:55.330 --> 42:57.590
When can you take these bandages off?

568
42:59.230 --> 43:00.470
In just a few days.

569
43:00.530 --> 43:02.480
It'll be back to normal in no time.

570
43:07.350 --> 43:08.800
What's with the sudden mood?

571
43:09.120 --> 43:10.680
Suddenly wanting to come and pray.

572
43:13.700 --> 43:15.160
We've been through so much together.

573
43:16.510 --> 43:19.580
I just wanted to come and pray for some good fortune in our lives.

574
43:21.960 --> 43:23.570
It's fitting for a fresh start.

575
43:23.600 --> 43:24.720
Doesn't hurt to do it, right?

576
43:34.620 --> 43:36.770
Now, repeat after me.

577
43:38.370 --> 43:39.170
Okay.

578
43:43.340 --> 43:44.300
"I am..."

579
43:45.400 --> 43:46.560
I am...

580
43:48.160 --> 43:49.760
"Mr. Mungkorn Phianwanich..."

581
43:51.710 --> 43:53.640
Mr. Mungkorn Phianwanich...

582
43:56.080 --> 43:59.340
"I hereby revoke my soul-binding oath

583
43:59.700 --> 44:01.790
with Mr. Theartha Phiromsamorn

584
44:02.470 --> 44:04.010
from this moment onward."

585
44:11.860 --> 44:14.520
"May all bonds come to an end.

586
44:14.830 --> 44:16.570
May both of us be set free.

587
44:17.150 --> 44:18.690
Each following their own karma,

588
44:19.090 --> 44:21.230
no longer affecting one another."

589
44:23.320 --> 44:24.820
What is the meaning of this?

590
44:33.430 --> 44:35.170
I think we should get a divorce.

591
44:54.400 --> 44:57.260
I've already had my father arrange your transfer to Phayao.

592
44:58.210 --> 45:01.010
From now on, there's nothing left between us.

593
45:14.140 --> 45:16.060
(Subject: Transfer of a Civil Servant)

594
45:16.090 --> 45:17.660
(To: Police Senior Sergeant Major Mungkorn Phianwanich)

595
45:18.040 --> 45:20.030
You planned every single thing...

596
45:21.640 --> 45:24.280
without ever thinking to talk to me? Not even a word?

597
45:26.000 --> 45:27.100
I used to think...

598
45:28.190 --> 45:29.890
that our love...

599
45:30.410 --> 45:33.010
would carry us through all this mess.

600
45:34.660 --> 45:35.760
But I was wrong.

601
45:38.220 --> 45:40.320
No one can defy destiny.

602
45:42.100 --> 45:45.800
I can't bear to see you get hurt because of me anymore.

603
45:55.800 --> 45:57.900
But is there really no other way?

604
46:00.640 --> 46:03.490
Didn't we promise that no matter what happened...

605
46:04.080 --> 46:06.480
we'd face it together?

606
46:23.340 --> 46:25.840
Since you've already made the decision yourself, Inspector...

607
46:41.720 --> 46:42.640
I am...

608
46:43.710 --> 46:45.570
Mr. Mungkorn Phianwanich.

609
46:47.790 --> 46:51.700
I hereby revoke my soul-binding oath...

610
46:53.720 --> 46:55.770
with Mr. Theartha Phiromsamorn

611
46:56.740 --> 46:58.440
from this moment onward.

612
47:01.690 --> 47:04.100
May all bonds come to an end.

613
47:05.670 --> 47:07.590
May both of us be set free.

614
47:08.410 --> 47:09.720
Each following their own karma,

615
47:11.520 --> 47:13.390
no longer affecting one another.

616
48:27.540 --> 48:29.240
Are you sure about this, Thear?

617
48:31.950 --> 48:32.660
Yes, Mom.

618
48:38.200 --> 48:40.400
The first time I met Mungkorn,

619
48:40.420 --> 48:43.720
I knew there was something very special between you two.

620
48:44.420 --> 48:45.780
Won't you reconsider?

621
48:46.410 --> 48:48.420
You two have been through so much together.

622
48:49.670 --> 48:50.470
Thear...

623
48:51.300 --> 48:52.990
We could find another way, son.

624
49:02.610 --> 49:04.310
Please don't try to stop Inspector Thear.

625
49:06.100 --> 49:07.570
I'm sure he's thought this through.

626
49:12.940 --> 49:14.700
If he believes this is the way out,

627
49:16.560 --> 49:18.740
we have to respect his decision.

628
49:21.560 --> 49:22.820
My life...

629
49:26.910 --> 49:27.700
has belonged to him

630
49:27.730 --> 49:29.590
ever since I agreed to sign that marriage certificate.

631
49:45.010 --> 49:46.310
(Mr. Theartha Phiromsamorn, Thai, 35 years old)

632
49:46.330 --> 49:47.560
(Mr. Mungkorn Phianwanich, Thai, 28 years old)

633
50:21.190 --> 50:24.370
(Chiang Mai Municipality)

634
50:32.840 --> 50:34.700
You can just drop me off here, Inspector.

635
50:35.910 --> 50:37.140
I'll take care of the rest myself.

636
50:42.660 --> 50:44.610
I could drive you all the way home.

637
50:48.150 --> 50:49.410
It's better if you don't.

638
50:51.060 --> 50:52.830
Please, no more kindness.

639
50:54.970 --> 50:57.100
That way, neither of us owes the other anything.

640
51:10.280 --> 51:11.050
Here.

641
51:11.940 --> 51:13.780
A million-baht check, as promised.

642
51:17.200 --> 51:18.560
Take good care of yourself.

643
51:25.560 --> 51:27.600
I want to thank you for everything.

644
51:30.460 --> 51:31.620
About the house...

645
51:32.540 --> 51:35.460
if you run into any trouble, just let me know.

646
51:35.570 --> 51:36.590
I'll help you out myself.

647
51:44.280 --> 51:46.280
I'd rather not accept this.

648
51:52.180 --> 51:53.690
With a civil servant's salary like mine,

649
51:54.860 --> 51:56.410
I should be able to get a loan anyway.

650
51:57.800 --> 51:59.310
I don't need to depend on you.

651
52:00.620 --> 52:01.340
But...

652
52:01.820 --> 52:03.740
But this is what you deserve.

653
52:04.900 --> 52:06.620
For all the time you've lost.

654
52:13.530 --> 52:15.220
I'll consider it a life lesson.

655
52:17.750 --> 52:19.840
It's worth far more than this check.

656
52:34.480 --> 52:35.790
I have to go now.

657
52:38.560 --> 52:40.160
Thank you for everything.

658
52:59.390 --> 53:00.280
Inspector.

659
53:05.580 --> 53:07.380
I hope you stay safe,

660
53:08.710 --> 53:10.250
now and forever.

661
53:22.550 --> 53:26.410
♪I'm sorry for hurting you♪

662
53:27.710 --> 53:31.530
♪And all the pain I've put you through♪

663
53:31.900 --> 53:36.390
♪But I can't turn back time♪

664
53:36.680 --> 53:42.590
♪To make things right♪

665
53:44.590 --> 53:47.990
♪I'm sorry I was blind♪

666
53:48.020 --> 53:52.850
♪To the tears behind your eyes♪

667
53:53.610 --> 53:57.970
♪They're the clearest evidence♪

668
53:58.000 --> 54:03.950
♪That I've been so heartless♪

669
54:05.630 --> 54:10.790
♪The only way to stop your pain♪

670
54:11.120 --> 54:16.340
♪Is to leave and not return again♪

671
54:16.700 --> 54:21.460
♪Despite our love, I need this to be over♪

672
54:21.490 --> 54:27.180
♪I can't watch you suffer any longer♪

673
54:28.050 --> 54:33.270
♪I'm the one who deserves to cry♪

674
54:33.290 --> 54:37.040
♪I've lost the right to have you by my side♪

675
54:37.070 --> 54:40.080
♪I'm letting go of your hand♪

676
54:41.400 --> 54:43.280
I'm begging you. Please tell me how to fix this.

677
54:44.360 --> 54:47.830
Mungkorn shall take your misfortune upon himself

678
54:48.750 --> 54:54.390
until the day one of you betrays the vows or ends the marriage.

679
54:54.820 --> 54:57.720
Another way lies in divorce.

680
54:58.050 --> 54:59.050
When that time comes,

681
54:59.590 --> 55:04.190
the scales of fate will gradually return to their former balance.

682
55:04.690 --> 55:10.180
♪The only way to stop your pain♪

683
55:10.210 --> 55:15.720
♪Is to leave and not return again♪

684
55:15.750 --> 55:20.250
♪Despite our love, I need this to be over♪

685
55:20.490 --> 55:26.350
♪I can't watch you suffer any longer♪

686
55:27.060 --> 55:32.240
♪I'm the one who deserves to cry♪

687
55:32.270 --> 55:36.020
♪I've lost the right to have you by my side♪

688
55:36.050 --> 55:39.080
♪I'm letting go of your hand♪

689
55:39.100 --> 55:44.520
♪The more I hold on, the more selfish I am♪

690
55:44.540 --> 55:48.450
♪Don't you agree?♪

691
55:49.110 --> 55:54.350
♪I'm the one who should be crying♪

692
55:54.370 --> 55:58.120
♪I'll gladly say goodbye, though inside I'm dying♪

693
55:58.140 --> 56:01.220
♪Our time has finally run out♪

694
56:01.250 --> 56:07.090
♪It's only right that I must leave♪

695
56:07.400 --> 56:12.940
♪Let me be the one to grieve♪

696
56:33.260 --> 56:38.500
♪I'm the one who should be crying♪

697
56:38.520 --> 56:42.270
♪I'll gladly say goodbye, though inside I'm dying♪

698
56:42.290 --> 56:45.370
♪Our time has finally run out♪

699
56:45.400 --> 56:51.240
♪It's only right that I must leave♪

700
56:51.550 --> 56:56.650
♪Let me be the one to grieve♪

701
57:02.320 --> 57:04.290
If you really want Mungkorn back,

702
57:04.310 --> 57:06.970
you need to show him that you mean it this time.

703
57:06.990 --> 57:07.900
Go away!

704
57:08.120 --> 57:08.870
No.

705
57:08.900 --> 57:10.290
Not until you forgive me.

706
57:11.220 --> 57:11.900
Mungkorn...

707
57:11.930 --> 57:12.940
Do you find it that easy

708
57:12.970 --> 57:15.490
to keep changing what we are to each other?

709
57:15.580 --> 57:17.710
If you can't take it anymore, then forgive me.

710
57:17.860 --> 57:20.190
Can't you give us another chance?

711
57:20.610 --> 57:21.410
I...

712
